# The dev server talks to the live relay of Kranox, as the build for app.kranox.cash does, so that every quote, scan,
# and swap is real; the relay answers the origin http://localhost:5181 (the port of vite.config.ts, which
# scripts/deploy/relay.mts names). For a relay on this machine, put its address and its public key into
# .env.relay.local and run "pnpm dev:relay".
VITE_RELAY_URL=https://relay.kranox.cash
VITE_RELAY_SIGNING_KEYS=BB4chM66jqZnchD0UpwidNxMraJruYq9wtklECLjmxfO16kSU1zwaytcXxw/Pe7ZgELErnFzgLtqHLenYTnzZPk=
